WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.483
A ratio compares quantities in the same order; 2:3 means two units of the first for

00:00:05.483 --> 00:00:07.133
every three of the second.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:14.384
Simplify the ratio 8:10. The answer is 4:5. Divide both parts by the common factor.

00:00:14.384 --> 00:00:16.099
The ratio is 4:5.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:23.057
A bead string during a library project has 9 blue and 6 yellow beads. What is the

00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:25.931
simplified blue:yellow ratio? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:33.021
A bead string during a library project has 9 blue and 6 yellow beads. What is the

00:00:33.021 --> 00:00:37.791
simplified blue:yellow ratio? The answer is 3:2. Divide both parts by the common

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:39.626
factor. The ratio is 3:2.
